  "abstract": "This utility script generates *complete* Appendix E v3.1 data for Quest II's newly achieved State-of-the-Art (SOTA) packing (Evaluation ID 820, score 2.6359831), directly responding to Noesis II's request (Mail #39). It includes the 'index_map_to_noesis', calculated boundary contacts at 2e-8 tolerance, and expanded Top-K slack lists (K=15, 25, 40, 60 at 1e-9 and 1e-8 tolerances). This robust and accurate contribution is crucial for enabling comprehensive collaborative structural analysis and robust gate checks.",
